{"person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","as_name":"马大元的鬼魂","kind":"false_identity","when":null,"where":"place:canon:madayuanjia","believed_by":[],"as_person":"person:canon:madayuan","ch":[24,24],"b":"text","ev":[[24,141,7,17,"94089f5fdbc62eed"],[24,132,18,32,"43f6cfb241474fef"]],"tag":"text","note":"乔峰在黑暗中一动不动立在门口，借段正淳的呼喊装作亡者讨命；白世镜明确不信鬼，康敏则一度惊怕、后又不再惧，没有人确切当真"}
{"person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","as_name":"乔装的汉子","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:madayuanjia","believed_by":[],"ch":[24,24],"b":"text","ev":[[24,184,16,25,"8538689c551ac1b5"]],"tag":"text","note":"乔峰仍贴着假须在马家窗外窥探，直到康敏面前才扯下假须露出真面目；所扮是何人本回未说，丐帮众人始终没见到他"}
{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"白世镜","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:madayuanjia","believed_by":[],"as_person":"person:canon:baishijing","ch":[24,24],"b":"text","ev":[[24,220,45,53,"d16751e9e98240d1"],[24,223,151,161,"7b57837b86612de3"]],"tag":"text","note":"追述：阿朱此前扮成白世镜去套康敏的话，康敏当晚就看出破绽，进而认出同来的乔峰；乔峰事后才弄明白其中缘故，康敏并未当真"}
